Mechanism of Action: LPAA addresses quality of life and meaningful participation beyond impairment reduction. Group therapy provides naturalistic practice with understanding peers. Activity-specific preparation reduces anxiety and ensures relevant vocabulary access. Confidence building through graduated success reduces communication avoidance. Systematic reintegration promotes generalization to real-world contexts while maintaining support.
