Measurement: Implementation success, student feedback
GAS: -2: Cannot implement; -1: 2-3 modifications; 0: 5-6 modifications with amplification; +1: Seamless integration; +2: Student evaluations improve
STG 6: AAC System Establishment (Supports LTG 5)
Michael will independently use text-to-speech AAC application for supplemental communication and complete voice banking to preserve natural voice for future use.
Timeline: Weeks 3-12
Measurement: AAC proficiency and voice banking completion
GAS: -2: Unable to use; -1: Basic use; 0: Independent use + voice banking complete; +1: Integrated use; +2: Creates personalized system
